<h1 style="margin:0 0 12px 0;font-size:24px;line-height:32px;letter-spacing:-0.02em;">Your password was changed</h1>
<p style="margin:0;font-size:15px;line-height:24px;color:#58534a;">Hi {{name}}, the password for your {{brand.name}} account was just changed and other signed-in devices were signed out.</p>
<p style="margin:16px 0 0 0;font-size:15px;line-height:24px;color:#58534a;">If this wasn't you, reset your password right away.</p>
{{> button url=forgotUrl label="Reset password"}}
